Package: TCGASigSurvival
Type: Package
Title: Gene, Cell Context and State Signature Survival Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Yantong", "Wan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "113027690+yantongwan@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Reusable pan-TCGA survival analysis utilities for combining a
    target gene expression value with a configurable cell-type gene signature
    score, or for testing a configurable signature score alone, then producing
    Cox tables, Kaplan-Meier plots, forest plots, and heatmaps from UCSC Xena
    TCGA expression and survival data. The package also provides CPTAC
    proteogenomic validation readers and wrappers for independent RNA-protein,
    marker, survival, and TCGA-CPTAC effect-size integration outputs. Two-layer
    models separate cell-context scores from state signatures, with continuous,
    adjusted and cell-context-high analyses. Custom expression cohorts,
    public-data downloads, batch analyses, and matched proteogenomic analyses
    are supported without bundling patient data.
URL: https://github.com/yantongwan/TCGASigSurvival
BugReports: https://github.com/yantongwan/TCGASigSurvival/issues
